  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "warmup",
      "kind": "exercise",
      "title": "Warm-up",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "w1",
          "interaction": "multiple-choice",
          "prompt": "[S1] On the number line, which number is farther from 0: −7 or 5?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "A",
              "text": "−7"
            },
            {
              "id": "B",
              "text": "5"
            },
            {
              "id": "C",
              "text": "They are equally far"
            },
            {
              "id": "D",
              "text": "Cannot tell"
            }
          ],
          "answer": "A",
          "solution": "距离看绝对值：|−7|=7，|5|=5，故 −7 离 0 更远。",
          "level": "warmup"
        },
        {
          "id": "w2",
          "interaction": "true-false",
          "prompt": "[S1] True or False: −3 > −8.",
          "answer": true,
          "solution": "在数轴上 −3 在 −8 右侧，所以 −3 更大。",
          "level": "warmup"
        },
        {
          "id": "w3",
          "interaction": "fill-blank",
          "prompt": "[S1] The opposite of −12 is ____.",
          "answer": "12",
          "solution": "相反数互为符号相反：−(−12)=12。",
          "level": "warmup"
        },
        {
          "id": "w4",
          "interaction": "multiple-choice",
          "prompt": "[S1] A thermometer reads −2°C in the morning and rises by 7°C. What is the new reading?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "A",
              "text": "−9°C"
            },
            {
              "id": "B",
              "text": "5°C"
            },
            {
              "id": "C",
              "text": "9°C"
            },
            {
              "id": "D",
              "text": "−5°C"
            }
          ],
          "answer": "B",
          "solution": "−2+7=5，故新读数为 5°C。",
          "level": "warmup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "notes",
      "kind": "passage",
      "title": "Key Ideas",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "html": "<p><strong>有向数</strong>包括正数、负数和 0。在数轴上，右为正、左为负；越靠右越大。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "html": "<p><strong>绝对值</strong> |a| 表示 a 到 0 的距离，结果非负。例：|−4|=4，|0|=0。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "html": "<p><strong>加减</strong>：同号相加取同号；异号相加取绝对值较大者的符号，再减绝对值。减去一个数 = 加上它的相反数：a−b=a+(−b)。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4",
          "html": "<p><strong>乘除</strong>：同号得正，异号得负。例：(−3)×(−4)=12，(−18)÷6=−3。</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p5",
          "html": "<p><strong>运算顺序</strong>：先括号，再乘除，后加减；多层括号由内向外。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-l1",
