        {
          "id": "l1-7",
          "interaction": "fill-blank",
          "prompt": "[S1] A scuba diver is at −12 m. She descends another 9 m. Her new depth is ____ m. (Use a directed number.)",
          "answer": "-21",
          "solution": "−12+(−9)=−21。",
          "level": "L1"
        },
        {
          "id": "l1-8",
          "interaction": "fill-blank",
          "prompt": "[S2] Evaluate: (−2)³ − (−8) = ____  (interpret (−2)³ as (−2)×(−2)×(−2))",
