          "interaction": "fill-blank",
          "prompt": "[S3] Evaluate: −[ (−6) − (−2) × 5 ] ÷ (−4) = ____",
          "answer": "1",
          "solution": "内：(-2)×5=−10；(−6)−(−10)=−6+10=4；−[4]÷(−4)=−4÷(−4)=1。",
          "level": "challenge"
